[{"answer":"A lot of people have hobbies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Hobbies are interesting things that people like to do in their spare time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/2.mp3"},{"answer":"My father has a hobby.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/3.mp3"},{"answer":"He has a model railroad set that he put together.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/4.mp3"},{"answer":"A tiny electric train runs through make-believe villages","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/5.mp3"},{"answer":"and travels through tunnels and over mountains.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/6.mp3"},{"answer":"My father also enjoys sailing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/7.mp3"},{"answer":"He has a real sailboat that he takes us out on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/8.mp3"},{"answer":"He is teaching me how to sail.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I like to collect things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I collect comic books, stamps and coins.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I trade comic books with some of my friends,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/12.mp3"},{"answer":"and sometimes I buy comic books at stores.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Some of the very old comic books are worth a lot of money.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I have stamps from all over the world.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Whenever any of my friends get a letter from a faraway place,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/16.mp3"},{"answer":"they save the stamps for me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/17.mp3"},{"answer":"I have stamps from England, Japan, Australia and even Russia.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I use a magnifying glass to look at the stamps,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/19.mp3"},{"answer":"and I keep them in a special album.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/20.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't have too many coins yet,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/21.mp3"},{"answer":"but I have a very old dime from Canada,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/22.mp3"},{"answer":"and I have a coin with a hole in it from Africa.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/23.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother used to collect dolls when she was a little girl.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/24.mp3"},{"answer":"The dolls wore costumes from different countries.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/25.mp3"},{"answer":"My friend John's hobby is painting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/26.mp3"},{"answer":"He does oil painting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/27.mp3"},{"answer":"He has even sold some of his paintings.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/28.mp3"},{"answer":"He is a good artist.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/29.mp3"},{"answer":"My friend Linda sews.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/30.mp3"},{"answer":"She has made clothes for herself and some of her friends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe Linda will be a fashion designer when she gets older.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes people's hobbies lead them into their careers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/82-hobbies-2019-03-29-13-09-18/33.mp3"}]
